; The project now lives under a path containing "&" (M&H Developments).
; npm's default script runner shells out via cmd.exe, which treats an
; unescaped & in the *working directory path* as a command separator,
; breaking every "npm run <script>" (build, dev, etc.) with errors like
; "'H' is not recognized as an internal or external command". PowerShell
; doesn't have this problem, so scope the script shell to this project only
; rather than changing it machine-wide.
script-shell=powershell.exe
